<title>USA: Physician Computer plans Q1 stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Physician Computer plans Q1 stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS PLAINS, N.J. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physician Computer Network Inc said it plans to exercise its option to repurchase 2,325,000 shares of its common stock from IBM Credit Corp at a price of $4.60 prior to the end of the first quarter.</p>
</text>
